  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: "2026-11-25",
    modifiedTime: "2026-11-25",
    author: "Shaheer Ali Khan",
    section: "Fitness Equipment",
    tags: [
      "cybergoing walking pad",
      "cybergoing treadmill",
      "cybergoing t10",
      "cybergoing t12",
      "cybergoing t16",
      "cybergoing walking pad review",
      "is cybergoing legit",
      "walking pad powered by bosch",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "Best Cybergoing Walking Pad: Cybergoing T10", link: PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/brands/">Brands</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Brand Guide</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Cybergoing Walking Pad Review: The Bosch-Motor T10</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Cybergoing is a real but very new walking pad brand, and its T10, at about $142 on Amazon, is a fair buy for slow under-desk walking if you are well under 300 lb and want a built-in incline. The Bosch motor is a listing claim with no power figure behind it, and the warranty is 12 months.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 25, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS<br />
          <span class="ed-method">Based on the brand’s published specifications and warranty terms, retailer listings and owner reports.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        Some links on this page are affiliate links: we may earn a commission at no cost to you. <a href="/editorial-standards/">How we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#cybergoing-t10"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mL3oKtRZL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Cybergoing T10" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#cybergoing-t12"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LrEmMan8L._SL500_.jpg" alt="Cybergoing T12" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#cybergoing-t16"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gZ8+WRLVL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Cybergoing T16" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Cybergoing T10 · Cybergoing T12 · Cybergoing T16</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          Cybergoing is one of the newest names in Amazon's walking pad results, and it stands out for one line in every
          listing title: "Powered By Bosch". It sells three machines on Amazon: the T10, a flat under-desk pad with a
          remote; the T12, a compact pad with a handle bar; and the T16, a bigger treadmill with handrails and a colour
          display. All three have a fixed 7% incline. Prices on 25 November 2026 ran from about $142 to about $218. This
          guide sets out who Cybergoing is, what each Amazon listing claims and leaves out, what the Bosch line does and
          does not tell you, what the warranty and return terms on Cybergoing's own site say, and which machine, if any,
          to buy.
        </p>

        <section id="top-picks" class="ed-toppicks not-prose">
          <h2>Our top picks:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best Cybergoing Walking Pad:</span> <a href="#cybergoing-t10">Cybergoing T10</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best for Light Jogging:</span> <a href="#cybergoing-t12">Cybergoing T12</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[1].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Highest Listed Capacity:</span> <a href="#cybergoing-t16">Cybergoing T16</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[2].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
