          <ul>
            <li><strong>T10:</strong> the Cybergoing app or a remote. With no handrails there is no console to reach, so the
            remote is how most people will change speed while working.</li>
            <li><strong>T12:</strong> the Cybergoing app or onboard buttons. The listing does not mention a remote.</li>
            <li><strong>T16:</strong> the app or onboard buttons, plus an RGB colour display to track progress.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            The listings do not describe what the Cybergoing app does beyond adjusting speed, whether it records sessions,
