            the closest matches from brands with a longer record on Amazon, and they show what you trade.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[520px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Walking pad</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Price (Amazon, 25 Nov 2026)</th>
